From 3a4eaed3ea2f10dc5dd2f4e739bdc235cc452869 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 16:57:04 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat: sync the portal with the homeschool API using
 change-only writes

Replaces the PHP whole-snapshot sync. The portal loads a student snapshot from
/api/v1 and, on every save, sends only what changed, so an out-of-date device
can no longer overwrite newer work. localStorage stays as the instant cache;
queued edits survive a reload and retry when the network returns.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
